<BaseLayout title="About" description="Crate Theory is a site for hip hop producers, audio engineers, and neo soul heads who take the craft seriously.">

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-cream uppercase tracking-tight mb-8">About Crate Theory</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-ct max-w-none">

      <p>
        Crate Theory is a site for producers, engineers, and music heads who take the craft seriously.
        We cover hip hop production, pro audio gear, neo soul, home studio builds, DJ equipment, vinyl collecting,
        music software, and music theory — with an emphasis on actually knowing what you're talking about.
      </p>

      <p>
        You'll find gear reviews, production tutorials, free sample packs and MIDI kits, and deep-dive guides on
        the tools and techniques that move the culture forward.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Cover</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/hip_hop_production">Hip Hop Production</a> — beatmaking, sampling, drum programming, DAW workflows</li>
        <li><a href="/pro_audio">Pro Audio</a> — studio monitors, interfaces, microphones, signal chain</li>
        <li><a href="/neo_soul">Neo Soul</a> — keys, chords, arrangement, live instruments</li>
        <li><a href="/home_studio">Home Studio</a> — room treatment, gear selection, budget builds</li>
        <li><a href="/dj_gear">DJ Gear</a> — controllers, turntables, mixers, software</li>
        <li><a href="/vinyl_collecting">Vinyl</a> — record hunting, playback setup, pressing quality</li>
        <li><a href="/music_software">Music Software</a> — DAWs, plugins, VSTs, samplers</li>
        <li><a href="/music_theory">Music Theory</a> — scales, harmony, chord progressions for producers</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Free Downloads</h2>
      <p>
        We offer free sample packs, MIDI kits, and loops with no email gate. If it's good enough to make beats with,
        it's worth giving away. <a href="/downloads">Browse the downloads section</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you buy something through a link, we may earn a small commission
        at no extra cost to you. We only recommend gear we'd actually use. See our full
        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a>.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</BaseLayout>
